#: ../../docstring 336783ececf04b07aed8e1f323816a04 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.assign_charges:8
msgid "If `charges` is not a valid sequence."
msgstr "`charges` が有効なシーケンスでない場合。"

#: ../../docstring 2c6aef19273f4be7af2c24b613d53435 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.assign_charges:9
msgid "If the length of `charges` does not match the total atom count."
msgstr "`charges` の長さが総原子数と一致しない場合。"

#: ../../docstring 345666227ec644b3b542ec4b8bcaabb7 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.atoms:1
msgid "Returns a list of (key, atom) pairs for all atoms directly in this group."
msgstr "このグループに直接含まれるすべての原子の (key, atom) ペアのリストを返す。"

#: ../../docstring 2775f83dd201469e8bdd5915248b0c01 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.atoms:3
msgid ""
"If :attr:`sort_atoms` is set to ``\"nice\"``, the items are sorted "
"naturally."
msgstr ":attr:`sort_atoms` が ``\"nice\"`` に設定されている場合、項目は自然順にソートされる。"

#: ../../docstring 95ba099fd7a644d3b325dd8c9fee4e2d of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.atoms:5
msgid "List of (key, atom) pairs."
msgstr "(key, atom) ペアのリスト。"

#: ../../docstring c414cf1a643b40d1bd5f71120672b972 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.bonds:1
msgid "Returns a list of bond records stored directly in this group."
msgstr "このグループに直接保存されている結合レコードのリストを返す。"

#: ../../docstring 36cbb1ff270c4428bfff88d69b430766
#: b8602d31b3db401f96229981c6e7cfb5 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.bonds:3
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.get_bond_list:3
msgid "List of `(atom1_path, atom2_path, order)` tuples."
msgstr "`(atom1_path, atom2_path, order)` タプルのリスト。"

#: ../../docstring 29618fec66924fc690e9e1e3039e2e98
#: e97bfa1033b446bba323f595700b579f of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.box:1
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.get_box:1
msgid ""
"Computes the axis-aligned bounding box enclosing all atoms in the "
"hierarchy."
msgstr "階層内のすべての原子を囲む軸平行バウンディングボックスを計算する。"

#: ../../docstring df8362f2e00442289afe40fe9a474869
#: ef9ff90981d347bbb39c1a8038f3d255 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.box:3
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.get_box:5
msgid "A tuple of `(min_position, max_position)`."
msgstr "`(min_position, max_position)` のタプル。"

#: ../../docstring ee0e66ba265a4a2c8093d4024504da7f of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.center:1
msgid "Computes the geometric center (centroid) of all atoms in the hierarchy."
msgstr "階層内のすべての原子の幾何中心(重心)を計算する。"

#: ../../docstring 46000de2b8124cc89b0667fc9412881b of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.center:3
msgid "The centroid coordinates."
msgstr "重心座標。"

#: ../../docstring f7a0d96b930040c68e8448f1e1ba8d17 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.charge:1
msgid "Total electric charge of this group and all its descendant groups."
msgstr "このグループおよびそのすべての子孫グループの全電荷。"

#: ../../docstring 61b7b8c06aa14c4ebd5f317dd08e586d of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.charge:3
msgid "Sum of atomic partial charges."
msgstr "原子部分電荷の総和。"

#: ../../docstring 2fafdea762db45bdb8311f01c070cb3c of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.check_missing_atoms:1
msgid "Checks for missing and unexpected atoms based on CCD residue templates."
msgstr "CCD残基テンプレートに基づいて欠損原子および予期しない原子を検査する。"

#: ../../docstring e6edece412144fcebf7c2edcb6ec7945 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.check_missing_atoms:6
msgid "Whether to include hydrogen atoms in the check. Defaults to False."
msgstr "検査に水素原子を含めるかどうか。デフォルトは False。"

#: ../../docstring 37b1a04da18f41bcb8020085ef023b40 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.check_missing_atoms:10
msgid "Summary report of missing and unexpected atoms."
msgstr "欠損原子および予期しない原子のサマリーレポート。"

#: ../../docstring 2ca9c28ddf0048cb955914c858dc7fa7 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.complete_missing_atoms:1
msgid "Reconstructs and adds missing heavy atoms based on CCD residue templates."
msgstr "CCD残基テンプレートに基づいて欠損重原子を再構築して追加する。"

#: ../../docstring bb0472a4c3f3461e839c7157508ade18 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.complete_missing_atoms:6
msgid "Maximum allowed anchor superposition RMSD in Angstroms. Defaults to 1.0."
msgstr "オングストローム単位のアンカー重ね合わせRMSDの許容最大値。デフォルトは 1.0。"

#: ../../docstring d98b0f5cb73e411d877c040795b854e9 of
#: proteindf_bridge.atomgroup.AtomGroup.complete_missing_atoms:10
msgid "Summary report of completed and skipped residues."
msgstr "補完された残基およびスキップされた残基のサマリーレポート。"

#: ../../docstring 48346f4d391843069d42188dabf4e32d
